This "creative" kit was created at the request of a friend and colleague who practices watercolor during her trips and walks.

She tended to carry her creative tools (an eraser, a pencil, a small rag, a pencil sharpener and a small box of watercolors) sometimes loose in an unsuitable bag or satchel.

After selecting the colors in the [list of leathers](notion:b82a8bf9ee1040e0816e7a0581027cbd), we chose together the shapes and tested the ideas in the form of a prototype to create a custom product, which I offer here for reproduction to order.

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

